; Diagnostic: the PureMetal Apple IIc demo (demo/apple2c_demo.apple2c, built by PureMetalForge's Apple IIc
; board into a disk that boots) in drive 1 of the public machine on the Pico 2 W; key D boots it.
; tools/pack_disk.py demo/apple2c_demo.dsk build/demo_disk.pmi writes the disk's data.
#CPU_ASM_TAIL = 1
#CPU_TAIL_T2 = 1                         ; the Thumb-2 tail on the Cortex-M33
#A2_ROM = 0
#A2_DISK = 1
#A2_AUDIO = 0
XIncludeFile "../../build/demo_disk.pmi"
XIncludeFile "../apple2c_body.pico2"
Main()
